{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RAmRq9yjD4SKezQERZV79S","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 0019: Customer from herd-device-api\n2\t\n3\tStub: write the full record from the design doc section below, using 0000-template.md.\n4\t\n5\t- **Status:** Accepted\n6\t- **Date:** 2026-10-20 (settled with the team, design doc option)\n7\t- **Design doc section:** Where the customer comes from (Processor and DynamoDB index, p.29 to p.32)\n8\t\n9\t## Decision (summary)\n10\t\n11\tThe processor looks up the customer by MAC in herd-device-api through its Cloud8 SDK, with a 15-minute cache so a short outage is mostly absorbed. The MAC to customer endpoint still needs confirming in its api/openapi.yaml, so the POC uses a stub that answers \"unassigned\". SMP was the other option.\n12\t\n13\t## Rules for agents\n14\t\n15\tThe customer comes only through `CustomerLookup`.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"58c40e15-a7ad-48c1-95e5-715566e5e7dc","uuid":"35b4a7e4-e60e-4011-a6b4-101a16bea1d9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:23:06.191Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/hq/3cj1j26n6m7cd0qtmj18nmz40000gp/T/herd-bench-deep-before-4akjtri5/docs/architecture/decisions/0019-customer-from-herd-device-api.md","content":"# 0019: Customer from herd-device-api\n\nStub: write the full record from the design doc section below, using 0000-template.md.\n\n- **Status:** Accepted\n- **Date:** 2026-10-20 (settled with the team, design doc option)\n- **Design doc section:** Where the customer comes from (Processor and DynamoDB index, p.29 to p.32)\n\n## Decision (summary)\n\nThe processor looks up the customer by MAC in herd-device-api through its Cloud8 SDK, with a 15-minute cache so a short outage is mostly absorbed. The MAC to customer endpoint still needs confirming in its api/openapi.yaml, so the POC uses a stub that answers \"unassigned\". SMP was the other option.\n\n## Rules for agents\n\nThe customer comes only through `CustomerLookup`.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
